<div class="faq">
  <div class="container-lg">
    <div class="faq-layout">
      <div class="faq-heading">
        <h3>Plans <span class="amp">&amp;</span> Billing FAQs</h3>
        <span class="faq-corner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-panel">
        <div class="question-area">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-10">
              <div class="question">What is SparkToro's cancellation policy?</div>
              <div class="answer hidden" id="question-3">
                <p>You may cancel your SparkToro subscription or change plans at any time by clicking on the "cancel subscription" button on the My Account->Subscription page. Your paid plan will end on the date of your next billing cycle (i.e. the month or year anniversary of whenever you first paid for your subscription's start). We do not offer refunds for partial use, except in the cases of SparkToro-caused issues with account access or other problems. If this is the case, email us: <span class="bold"><a href="mailto:support@sparktoro.com">support@sparktoro.com</a></span> and we'll look into any troubles you've experienced.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-2">
              <div class="float-end icon" data-question="3"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-area">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-10">
              <div class="question" id="searches">Can I use software to run SparkToro reports?</div>
              <div class="answer hidden" id="question-1">
                <p>Yes — we offer two official ways to access SparkToro programmatically:</p>

                <p><strong><a href="/mcp/docs">MCP server</a></strong> — connect SparkToro to ChatGPT, Claude, Cursor, or any other Model Context Protocol-compatible client. Lets you build audiences and explore section data right inside your AI assistant. Free with any paid SparkToro subscription.</p>

                <p><strong><a href="/api">Public API</a></strong> — REST endpoints for building SparkToro into your own software, dashboards, and automations. Credit-metered pricing, separate from your SparkToro subscription.</p>

                <p>Outside of those official integrations, we don't allow the crawling or extraction of SparkToro results by bots, scrapers, or unauthorized automated software. We make substantive efforts to detect such queries, and accounts associated with them may be suspended or banned.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-2">
              <div class="float-end icon" data-question="1"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-area">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-10">
              <div class="question">How do I switch to a different plan?</div>
              <div class="answer hidden" id="question-2"> 
                <p>You can switch to a new plan at any time by going to the Billing page in your account. Select the plan you’d like to switch to and immediately start using new features.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-2">
              <div class="float-end icon" data-question="2"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-area">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-10">
              <div class="question">Can I subscribe monthly?</div>
              <div class="answer hidden" id="question-5">
                <p>You sure can, at the top of this pricing page there is a annual to monthly toggle that will update the pricing for monthly subscriptions. Below is what the toggle looks like.</p>
                <p class="center">
                  <a href="#price-switch">
                    <img src="//sparktoro.com/img/pricing/toggle.ff0f069f93146bfea462e15702e9671d.png" height="88" class="toggle-example" _cdn="true" />                  </a>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-2">
              <div class="float-end icon" data-question="5"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="question-area">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-10">
              <div class="question">Additional billing questions?</div>
              <div class="answer hidden" id="question-4"> 
                <p>If you have any additional questions, just send an email over to <span class="bold"><a href="mailto:support@sparktoro.com">support@sparktoro.com</a></span> and we will get back to you in a flash.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-2">
              <div class="float-end icon" data-question="4"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


